# Shirt tail prototype in game (Virginie, 2026-11-05: "lance un scénario pour faire la même chose en jeu").
# WDI draws the Male body, AB gives the trousers a worn graphic (config/shirt-tail seeds its categories), and the
# test-only mod nelim.venustouch.waistlines.shirttailproto replaces ShirtButton_Male south/east/north with the
# vanilla to WDI transfer (TailorMade's method, bands, C' tail). That mod lives in Art/work/shirt-tail-proto/Mod,
# gitignored: its textures are computed from Ludeon's. Venus' top fit and outline stay at their defaults (off).
#   Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod VenusTouchWaistlines -DepMap shirt-tail -Filter '28-shirt-tail'
